 itemprop="name">Our hotels Budapest</span><meta itemprop="position" content="2" /></a></li> <li class="breadcrumb-item" itemprop="itemListElement" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/ListItem"><a href="/en/our-hotels-budapest/hotel-hungaria-city-center" itemprop="item" title="Danubius Hotel Hungaria"><span itemprop="name">Danubius Hotel Hungaria</span><meta itemprop="position" content="3" /></a></li> <li class="breadcrumb-item" itemprop="itemListElement" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/ListItem"><a href="/en/our-hotels-budapest/hotel-hungaria-city-center/events-and-meetings" itemprop="item" title="Meetings"><b itemprop="name">Meetings</b><meta itemprop="position" content="4" /></a></li> </ol> </nav> </div> <main class="content with-hero hotel-page hotel-pages meetings-and-events-page" role="main"> <!-- CONTENT BEGIN --> <section class="content-header" data-windsurfer="14789" data-hotel-id="17" data-popupurl=""> <div class="hero-section position-relative"> <div class="img-holder z-index-1"> <picture><source srcset="/w/promoart/accommsub_229_en.jpg" media="(min-width: 768px)"> <img src="/w/promoart/accommsub_mobile_229_en.jpg" alt="" class="of-cover" /> </picture> </div> <div class="position-absolute z-index-3 top-0 start-0 w-100 text-white navibarlinks"> <div class="container padding-t-10 padding-b-30 lg-padding-t-20 lg-padding-b-75 navibar-container"> <nav aria-label="breadcrumb"> <ol class="breadcrumb" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/BreadcrumbList"> <li class="breadcrumb-item" itemprop="itemListElement" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/ListItem"><a href="/" itemprop="item" title="Home"><span itemprop="name">Home</span><meta itemprop="position" content="1" /></a></li> <li class="breadcrumb-item" itemprop="itemListElement" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/ListItem"><a href="/en/our-hotels-budapest" itemprop="item" title="Our hotels Budapest"><span itemprop="name">Our hotels Budapest</span><meta itemprop="position" content="2" /></a></li> <li class="breadcrumb-item" itemprop="itemListElement" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/ListItem"><a href="/en/our-hotels-budapest/hotel-hungaria-city-center" itemprop="item" title="Danubius Hotel Hungaria"><span itemprop="name">Danubius Hotel Hungaria</span><meta itemprop="position" content="3" /></a></li> <li class="breadcrumb-item" itemprop="itemListElement" itemscope itemtype="https://schema.org/ListItem"><a href="/en/our-hotels-budapest/hotel-hungaria-city-center/events-and-meetings" itemprop="item" title="Meetings"><b itemprop="name">Meetings</b><meta itemprop="position" content="4" /></a></li> </ol> </nav> </div> </div> <div class="position-absolute z-index-4 w-100 hotel-action-line"> <div class="container d-flex justify-content-end"> <a href="/en/danubius-proposal/direct-booking-discount" target="_blank" class="hotel-action text-decoration-none" data-bs-toggle="tooltip" data-bs-placement="bottom" data-bs-title="10% Direct Booking Discount" data-bs-custom-class="custom-tooltip-blue">10% Direct Booking Discount</a> </div> </div> <div class="position-absolute z-index-4 w-100 hotel-rating-line"> <div class="container d-flex justify-content-end"> <a href="/en/our-hotels-budapest/hotel-hungaria-city-center/reviews" class="hotel-rates text-decoration-none" data-bs-toggle="tooltip" data-bs-placement="bottom" data-bs-title="On a scale of 5.0." data-bs-custom-class="custom-tooltip-blue"> <span>4.7</span><i class="icon-star"></i> </a> </div> </div> <div class="position-absolute z-index-4 hotel-info-line"> <div class="container text-holder d-md-flex align-items-end padding-l-r-15 xl-padding-l-r-0"> <div> <p class="hotel-name h2 pb-2">Danubius Hotel Hungaria <sup>**** </sup></p> <h1 class="hotel-subtitle subtitle2 pb-3 pb-md-0">Conference room in center of Budapest</h1> </div> <div> <div class="arrival-dep d-flex"> <div> <span>Check in<br> from 15:00 </span> </div> <div> <span> Check out<br> until 11:00 </span> </div> </div> <div class="button-holder align-items-center d-flex"> <a href="https://booking.danubiushotels.com/ibe/index.aspx?propertyID=14789&langID=6" class="QuickBookerButton btn">Book now</a> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="gradient bg-gradient-banner z-index-2"></div> </div> </section> <section class="content-submenu-section margin-t-b-30 lg-margin-0"> <div class="container w-920"> <div class="content-submenu"> <div class="placeholder-text d-lg-none" onclick='document.getElementById("content-submenu-inner").style.display = "block";'><span>Meetings</span><i class="icon-down-open-big"></i></div> <div id="content-submenu-inner" class="content-submenu-inner"> <label class="content-submenu-title d-lg-none" onclick="document.getElementById('content-submenu-inner').style.display = 'none'">Meetings<i class="icon-up-open-big"></i></label> <ul> <li class=" has_submenu"> <a href="/en/our-hotels-budapest/hotel-hungaria-city-center" title="Danubius Hotel Hungaria - Overview">Overview</a> <span class="icon-down-open-big"></span> <div class="submenu_holder w-920"> <ul> <li class=""> <a href="/en/our-hotels-budapest/hotel-hungaria-city-center/services-and-amenities" >Services & Amenities </a> </li> </ul> </div> </li> <li class=" "> <a href="/en/our-hotels-budapest/hotel-hungaria-city-center/offers" title="Danubius Hotel Hungaria - Rates and offers">Rates and offers</a> </li> <li class=" "> <a href="/en/our-hotels-budapest/hotel-hungaria-city-center/rooms" title="Danubius Hotel Hungaria - Rooms">Rooms</a> </li> <li class=" "> <a href="/en/our-hotels-budapest/hotel-hungaria-city-center/dining" title="Danubius Hotel Hungaria - Dining">Dining</a> </li> <li class=" active"> <a href="/en/our-hotels-budapest/hotel-hungaria-city-center/events-and-meetings" title="Danubius Hotel Hungaria - Meetings">Meetings</a> </li> <li class=" "> <a href="/en/our-hotels-budapest/hotel-hungaria-city-center/picture-gallery" title="Danubius Hotel Hungaria - Picture gallery">Picture gallery</a> </li> <li class=" "> <a href="/en/our-hotels-budapest/hotel-hungaria-city-center/map-and-transportation" title="Danubius Hotel Hungaria - Map & transportation">Map & transportation</a> </li> </ul> </div> </div> </div> </section> <section class="margin-t-b-30 lg-margin-t-b-70"> <div class="container w-920"> <div class="right-side hotel-content meetings-and-events">  <h1 class="title">Meetings</h1> <div class="content-block lead-text row meetings-and-events"> <div class="col-12 col-lg-7 col-xl-8"> <div class="text"> <p style="text-align:justify !important;"><strong>We ensure the success of your event, however big! </strong><br>Organising a high-profile professional programme or corporate event always comes with a lot of responsibility. Success boils down to the details, and so it’s good to choose a venue that’s easily reachable, where the material requirements are in place, and where the bulk of the tasks related to organisation and execution are entrusted to an experienced, professional team.<br><br>The Danubius Hotel Hungaria City Center is located near the Papp László Budapest Sports Arena, the Puskás Ferenc Stadium and the BOK Sports and Conference Centre (formerly SYMA) just 5 km from the HUNGEXPO international exhibition centre and 6 km from the Tüskecsarnok event centre, and is thus an ideal place to stay even if you’re holding or attending an event somewhere in Budapest other than our hotel.&nbsp; <br><br>Our 12 air-conditioned event rooms, most benefiting from natural light, and boasting modern technical equipment, coupled with our well-trained staff, guarantee the success of any business, company or even family event.&nbsp; Our connecting conference rooms have a maximum capacity of 500 people, and we recommend them for seminars, smaller training events, lectures or business meetings.&nbsp; And thanks to its excellent features, our Beatrix Restaurant is in turn superbly equipped to provide catering for corporate events, client parties, receptions or gala dinners.&nbsp;</p><p style="text-align:justify !important;"><br>Our&nbsp;<strong>Danubius&nbsp;<font color="#ee855a">me:</font></strong>&nbsp;concept guarantees exceptional locations, modern AV solutions and event spaces that can be adapted to your needs. Find out more&nbsp;<a href="https://www.danubiushotels.com/hu/konferencia-es-rendezveny/plan-events-with-me" target="_self">here</a>.&nbsp;<br><br></p> </div> </div> <div class="col-12 col-lg-5 col-xl-4 valign-top"> <a class="meeting-tour-link" href="https://360tour.danubiushotels.com/hungaria/" target="_blank"><img src="/w/ssfiles/accomms_17_1896.jpg" class="dt-only" alt="Danubius Hotel Hungaria" ></a> <div class="meetings-capacity-holder"> <div><strong>500</strong><span>largest room capacity</span></div> <div><strong>390</strong><span>guests simultaneously</span></div> <div><strong>12</strong><span>event rooms</span></div> <div><strong>455 m2</strong><span>largest room size</span></div> </div> </div> </div> <script type="text/javascript"> AnonFunc.Include('Confrooms'); </script> <div class="border-top conference-rooms d-md-flex gx-4 justify-content-between w-100 align-items-center padding-b-30"> <h2 class="title">Conference & Event Rooms</h2> <div class="conference-enquiry-floor-holder d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center d-md-block w-100 md-w-auto padding-t-20 md-padding-0"> <a href="javascript:Confrooms.ViewFloorPlan();" class="margin-r-20 fs-14">View floor plan</a> <a href="javascript:Confrooms.MakeRequest();" class="btn btn-small">Send enquiry</a> </div> </div> <div class="white-box-border over-layer-box ConfRoomsFloorPlans"> <div class="container"> <div class="over-layer-head row"> <div class="d-none d-md-block col-9"> </div> <div class="over-layer-close col-3 align-right"> <a href="javascript:Confrooms.CloseFloorPlan();" class="text-decoration-none"><span class="icon-close"></span></a> </div> </div> <div class="over-layer-content row"> <div class="col-2"> <div style="margin: 0 10px 15px 0;"> <table cellspacing="0" cellpadding="0"> <tr> <td><a href=